msgid ""
"Are you sure you want delete Calibre-Web NextGen's sync database to force a "
"full sync with your Kobo Reader?"
msgstr ""
"Vill du verkligen ta bort Calibre-Web NextGens synkroniseringsdatabas för "
"att tvinga fram en fullständig synkronisering med din Kobo-läsare?"

